tag skate;

// The arena: a grid of cells, each a whole number of levels high, half a
// unit per level. A cell is paved, grass, a tree, a ramp that rises one
// level across it, or part of a pool's curved wall. Rows run toward +z and
// columns toward +x.
//
// Features: . paved, L a paved ledge with steel edges, g grass, t tree, p a
// planter, l a lamp post, Q a pool's wall (see pools), and ramps rising
// toward the arrow: > +x, < -x, v +z, ^ -z. A ramp's height is the level of
// its low end.
arena_features: str = """
tgggggtgggggtgggggtgggggtgggggtgggggtgggggtg
gggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggg
gg........................................gg
gg.............l..........l.QQQQQQQQQQ..l.gg
gg.................gggggg...QQQQQQQQQQ....gg
gg.................gtgggg...QQ......QQ....gg
gg......^^.........gggggg...QQ......QQ....gg
gg..>........<.....ggtgtg...QQ......QQ....gg
gg..>........<.....gggggg...QQ......QQ....gg
gg..........................QQ......QQ....gg
gg......^^..................QQ......QQ....gg
gg.l........................QQQQQQQQQQ....gg
gg..........................QQQQQQQQQQ....gg
