gg....QQ......QQ.........^^..........gtggggg
gg..^^..........^^..................pggggggg
gg..^^..........^^...................gggtggg
gg.................l....l.....l......ggtgggg
gg...................................ggggggg
gggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggg
gggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggg
""";

